  "prefLabel": "Ncr 532.08 Time Period for Extension of the 180 Day Period for Land Conversions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 532.08 Time Period for Extension of the 180 Day Period for Land Conversions. Approval from the director to extend the 180-day period for changes in land use shall be valid for up to 270 days from the original completion date of the cutting operation.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5302.08), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
